1
00:00:00,013 --> 00:00:03,883
- Sorry, Raj. It's girls' night out.
- Maybe another time.

2
00:00:06,553 --> 00:00:07,743
(Penny:)Okay.

3
00:00:08,255 --> 00:00:09,315
(Leonard:)Come on.

4
00:00:10,924 --> 00:00:13,984
Girls' night. Girls' night. Ooh! Ooh!

5
00:00:17,431 --> 00:00:19,261
(Stuart:)How does he not hear that?

6
00:00:21,869 --> 00:00:24,359
(Amy:)What's the plan?
We gonna teach our fellas a lesson...

7
00:00:24,538 --> 00:00:27,698
(Amy:)...by getting stinking drunk,
luring strange men into the bathroom...

8
00:00:27,875 --> 00:00:30,245
(Amy:)...and turning the toilet stall
into a temple of the senses?

9
00:00:31,678 --> 00:00:32,908
(Penny:)- No.
- No.

10
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:36,850
Jeez. Who's Forever 63 now?

11
00:00:37,851 --> 00:00:42,341
(Raj:)Can we get another bottle of champagne
for the table? Don't worry, it's my treat.

12
00:00:42,523 --> 00:00:45,223
- Thanks.
- You should come to girls' night more often.

13
00:00:45,392 --> 00:00:49,222
(Penny:)And not just because if you weren't here
this would be a can of Pabst.

14
00:00:49,396 --> 00:00:52,526
(Raj:)Nothing makes me happier
than the chance to spoil a lady.

15
00:00:52,699 --> 00:00:55,789
(Raj:)Just ask my dog. My vet says
if I give her any more foie gras...

16
00:00:55,969 --> 00:00:58,229
(Raj:)...she's going to die of gout.

17
00:00:59,373 --> 00:01:02,773
- Hey, let's help Raj meet a girl tonight.
- No, no, no, I'm fine.

